0 65 512 [
[(Here we try out [line~] and [vline~] to generate triangle)]
[(waves \050with ramps going up to 1 and down to -1\051. The subpatch)]
[(is still sending alternating bangs as in the last patch, but)]
[(now at every 2 ms, which creates a 250 Hz triangular)]
[(waveform.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 65 436 [
[(The effect of [line~] rounding breakpoints to the nearest)]
[(block \050on the order of a millisecond\051 is that each 4-ms-long)]
[(cycle has a different shape. Using [vline~] resolves the)]
[(problem. You can hear and check the graphs to the right.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
