/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 72 98 [
[(Sometimes you will want to use [vline~] in place of [sig~])]
[(for the same need to convert to signals with sample accuracy)]
[(\050since [sig~] can only convert and set a single value per)]
[(block\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
